# Generated audit reports and temporary diagnostics
# CONTRADICTION, owner decision required — docs/CONTENT_QUALITY_WAVES.md §Wave 1 п.1.4:
# audit/ is ignored here, yet audit/site-audit-report.md is tracked in git and is
# rewritten by scripts/audit_site.py on every run. The committed copy is stale
# (says 181 images / 155 article pages / 159 sitemap URLs; the real build produces
# 197 / 157 / 166). So every local audit run dirties the tree and the tracked
# snapshot misreports the site. AGENTS.md §10 forbids committing generated output.
